    {"q":"Which sentence is in the passive voice? (कर्मवाच्य पहचानिए)","o":["The thief was caught red-handed.","The police caught the thief.","The thief ran away.","The thief is running fast."],"a":0,"e":"be + V3 (was caught) = passive। शेष वाक्यों में कर्ता स्वयं क्रिया कर रहा है (active)।"},
    {"q":"Which of the following verbs is INTRANSITIVE and therefore has no passive form?","o":["build","eat","sleep","write"],"a":2,"e":"Intransitive verb (अकर्मक क्रिया) का कर्म नहीं होता, अतः passive नहीं बनता — sleep, go, come, die, laugh आदि। write, build, eat सकर्मक हैं।"},
    {"q":"Change the voice: The baby is sleeping.","o":["Sleep is being done by the baby.","The baby was being slept.","The baby is being slept.","This sentence cannot be changed into passive voice."],"a":3,"e":"sleep अकर्मक क्रिया है (कोई कर्म नहीं), इसलिए passive नहीं बनता।"},
    {"q":"Change the voice: Grandmother told us a story.","o":["We are told a story by Grandmother.","We were told a story by Grandmother.","Us were told a story by Grandmother.","We were tell a story by Grandmother."],"a":1,"e":"दो कर्म: व्यक्ति (us → We) को कर्ता बनाकर Simple Past → were + V3 (told)।"},
    {"q":"Change the voice: The peon opened the gate for the minister.","o":["The gate was open for the minister by the peon.","The gate was opened for the minister by the peon.","The gate is opened for the minister by the peon.","The minister was opened the gate by the peon."],"a":1,"e":"कर्म \"the gate\" कर्ता बनता है; \"for the minister\" वाक्यांश बना रहता है; Simple Past → was + V3।"},
    {"q":"Change the voice: The teacher is checking our copies.","o":["Our copies are being checked by the teacher.","Our copies were being checked by the teacher.","Our copies is being checked by the teacher.","Our copies are checked by the teacher."],"a":0,"e":"Present Continuous → are + being + V3; copies बहुवचन → are।"},
    {"q":"Change the voice: Ravi had not completed the homework.","o":["The homework had not completed by Ravi.","The homework was not being completed by Ravi.","The homework had not been completed by Ravi.","The homework has not been completed by Ravi."],"a":2,"e":"Past Perfect नकारात्मक → had + not + been + V3।"},
    {"q":"Change the voice: Did the boys plant these trees?","o":["Was these trees planted by the boys?","Did these trees planted by the boys?","Are these trees planted by the boys?","Were these trees planted by the boys?"],"a":3,"e":"Did से प्रश्न → Was/Were + subject + V3? these trees बहुवचन → Were।"},
    {"q":"Change the voice: The cat is chasing the mice.","o":["The mice are being chased by the cat.","The mice is being chased by the cat.","The mice are chased by the cat.","The mice were being chased by the cat."],"a":0,"e":"mice (mouse का बहुवचन) → are being chased।"},
    {"q":"Change the voice: Rabindranath Tagore composed our National Anthem.","o":["Our National Anthem is composed by Rabindranath Tagore.","Our National Anthem has composed by Rabindranath Tagore.","Our National Anthem was compose by Rabindranath Tagore.","Our National Anthem was composed by Rabindranath Tagore."],"a":3,"e":"Simple Past (composed) → was + V3। (राष्ट्रगान \"जन गण मन\" रवीन्द्रनाथ टैगोर ने रचा।)"},
    {"q":"Change the voice: Must I sign this form?","o":["Must this form be sign by me?","Must this form be signed by me?","Must this form signed by me?","Should this form be signed by me?"],"a":1,"e":"Modal प्रश्न: Must + subject + be + V3 + by me? Modal बदलता नहीं।"},
    {"q":"Change the voice: Who will lead the team?","o":["By whom will the team be lead?","By whom would the team be led?","By whom will the team be led?","By whom the team will be led?"],"a":2,"e":"Who → By whom; lead का V3 = led; प्रश्न-क्रम: will + subject + be + V3।"},
    {"q":"Change the voice: The judge has sentenced the criminal to death.","o":["The criminal has been sentenced to death by the judge.","The criminal had been sentenced to death by the judge.","The criminal has sentenced to death by the judge.","The criminal is sentenced to death by the judge."],"a":0,"e":"Present Perfect → has been + V3; \"to death\" वाक्यांश बना रहता है।"},
    {"q":"Change the voice: The flood damaged the crops.","o":["The crops are damaged by the flood.","The crops had damaged by the flood.","The crops were damaged by the flood.","The crops was damaged by the flood."],"a":2,"e":"Simple Past, बहुवचन (crops) → were + V3।"},
    {"q":"Change the voice: The boss has not signed the papers yet.","o":["The papers have not signed by the boss yet.","The papers has not been signed by the boss yet.","The papers were not signed by the boss yet.","The papers have not been signed by the boss yet."],"a":3,"e":"Present Perfect नकारात्मक; papers बहुवचन → have not been + V3।"},
    {"q":"Change the voice: She was knitting a sweater.","o":["A sweater is being knitted by her.","A sweater was being knitted by her.","A sweater was being knit by she.","A sweater was knitted by her."],"a":1,"e":"Past Continuous → was + being + V3; she → her।"},
    {"q":"Change the voice: The mother will feed the baby.","o":["The baby would be fed by the mother.","The baby will be fed by the mother.","The baby will be feed by the mother.","The baby will fed by the mother."],"a":1,"e":"Simple Future → will be + V3; feed का V3 = fed।"},
    {"q":"Change the voice: Who taught you French?","o":["By whom are you taught French?","By whom you were taught French?","By whom was you taught French?","By whom were you taught French?"],"a":3,"e":"Who → By whom; you के साथ were; teach का V3 = taught; प्रश्न-क्रम बना रहता है।"},
    {"q":"Change the voice: A dog bit him.","o":["He was bitten by a dog.","He was bite by a dog.","Him was bitten by a dog.","He is bitten by a dog."],"a":0,"e":"bite — bit — bitten; Simple Past → was + V3; him → He।"},
    {"q":"Change into active voice: The answer was not known to anyone.","o":["Nobody had known the answer.","The answer knew nobody.","Nobody knew the answer.","Nobody knows the answer."],"a":2,"e":"was not known to anyone → Nobody knew ... (not + anyone = nobody)। ध्यान दें: know के passive में \"to\" लगता है।"},
    {"q":"Change into active voice: The letters are being typed by the clerk.","o":["The clerk was typing the letters.","The clerk is typing the letters.","The clerk types the letters.","The clerk has typed the letters."],"a":1,"e":"are being + V3 → is + V-ing (clerk एकवचन)।"},
    {"q":"Change into active voice: The thief was being chased by the dog.","o":["The dog was chasing the thief.","The dog had chased the thief.","The dog chased the thief.","The dog is chasing the thief."],"a":0,"e":"was being + V3 (Past Continuous) → was + V-ing।"},
    {"q":"Change into active voice: Should the rules be followed by everyone?","o":["Should everyone followed the rules?","Would everyone follow the rules?","Should the rules follow everyone?","Should everyone follow the rules?"],"a":3,"e":"Modal + subject + be + V3 → Modal + नया कर्ता + V1?"},
    {"q":"Change into active voice: Why was the meeting cancelled by the manager?","o":["Why did the manager cancelled the meeting?","Why has the manager cancelled the meeting?","Why did the manager cancel the meeting?","Why the manager cancelled the meeting?"],"a":2,"e":"was + V3 (Simple Past) प्रश्न → Why + did + subject + V1?"},
    {"q":"Change into active voice: The trees have been cut down by the villagers.","o":["The villagers have cut down the trees.","The villagers are cutting down the trees.","The villagers has cut down the trees.","The villagers had cut down the trees."],"a":0,"e":"have been + V3 → have + V3; villagers बहुवचन → have।"},
    {"q":"Change the voice: The company has given him a promotion.","o":["He has given a promotion by the company.","He had been given a promotion by the company.","He has been given a promotion by the company.","Him has been given a promotion by the company."],"a":2,"e":"दो कर्म — व्यक्ति (him → He) कर्ता; Present Perfect → has been + V3।"},
    {"q":"Change the voice: The villagers welcomed the minister warmly.","o":["The minister was welcome warmly by the villagers.","The minister is welcomed warmly by the villagers.","The minister were welcomed warmly by the villagers.","The minister was welcomed warmly by the villagers."],"a":3,"e":"Simple Past → was + V3; क्रिया-विशेषण warmly बना रहता है।"},
    {"q":"Change the voice: Are you preparing the list?","o":["Was the list being prepared by you?","Is the list being prepared by you?","Are the list being prepared by you?","Is the list prepared by you?"],"a":1,"e":"Present Continuous प्रश्न → Is + subject + being + V3? list एकवचन → Is।"},
    {"q":"Change the voice: The police have arrested the smugglers.","o":["The smugglers have been arrested by the police.","The smugglers had been arrested by the police.","The smugglers has been arrested by the police.","The smugglers have arrested by the police."],"a":0,"e":"Present Perfect, बहुवचन (smugglers) → have been + V3।"},
    {"q":"Change the voice: You ought to keep your promise.","o":["Your promise ought to kept by you.","Your promise ought to have kept by you.","Your promise ought to be keep by you.","Your promise ought to be kept by you."],"a":3,"e":"ought to + V1 → ought to + be + V3; keep का V3 = kept।"},
    {"q":"Change the voice: Switch off the fan.","o":["The fan is switched off.","Let the fan be switched off.","Let the fan be switch off.","Let the fan switched off."],"a":1,"e":"आज्ञावाचक → Let + object + be + V3; phrasal verb का \"off\" बना रहता है।"}
